---
description: Catalog, evidence and generated-view integrity
globs: ["catalog/**", "docs/evidence/**", "registries/**", "configs/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Catalog is discovery metadata over Git truth. Query stable IDs; do not load it
wholesale. Preserve exact raw/imported bytes, availability, lineage and
negative evidence. Do not hand-edit generated projections. Cloud export is
historical/optional, not working memory or an acceptance gate.
